  "entity": "HCMv3.TimeManagement.DailyDuty",
  "overviewHtml": "<p>A duty for the roster lists (roster duty periods and roster daily duties), with its shift times.</p><p>Not read at present: the time engine and payroll take employees' duties from duty periods and roster groups, not from this list. The roster generator that would have used it was never live in the legacy system and was not ported. The roster schedule viewer shows its times when one appears in a roster.</p>",
